  "Security": "安全",
  "Gallery": "图库",
  "Download": "下载",
  "GitHub": "GitHub",
  "Try it now": "立即试用",
  "A chat server you run yourself.": "一个由你自己运行的聊天服务器。",
  "Haven is a free, open source alternative to Discord. It runs on your own computer, your friends join with a link, and there's no company in the middle.": "Haven 是免费开源的 Discord 替代品。它运行在你自己的电脑上，朋友们通过链接加入，中间没有任何公司。",
  "<svg class=\"ico ico-line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 20h16\"/></svg>Download Haven": "<svg class=\"ico ico-line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 20h16\"/></svg>下载 Haven",
  "Join the community server": "加入社区服务器",
  "Source on GitHub": "GitHub 上的源码",
  "The community server is online.": "社区服务器在线。",
  "What you see when you start it up.": "启动后你会看到这些。",
  "Haven works like a Discord server, but you host it yourself. Download the zip, run it, and it gives you a link your friends can use from a browser, the desktop app or the Android and iOS apps.": "Haven 用起来像 Discord 服务器，不过由你自己托管。下载压缩包，运行它，就会得到一个链接，朋友们可以在浏览器、桌面应用或 Android 和 iOS 应用里使用。",
  "There's no company in the middle. No account with us, no email or phone number, and nothing to pay for. Your messages, files and voice calls stay on your own server.": "中间没有任何公司。不用在我们这里注册账号，不需要邮箱或手机号，也不用花一分钱。你的消息、文件和语音通话都留在你自己的服务器上。",
  "Haven has been in development since February 2026. It's a spare-time project and it'll always be free.": "Haven 从 2026 年 2 月开始开发。这是一个业余时间做的项目，永远免费。",
  "Many helpful people with a shared passion for free, unfiltered and private chat have come together to improve it. Every change is public, with a <a href=\"https://github.com/ancsemi/Haven/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">changelog</a> updated every release.": "许多热心的人怀着对自由、不审查、私密聊天的共同热情聚在一起改进它。每次改动都是公开的，每个版本发布时都会更新<a href=\"https://github.com/ancsemi/Haven/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">更新日志</a>。",
  "The short version. The <a href=\"https://github.com/ancsemi/Haven/blob/main/GUIDE.md\">guide</a> covers everything.": "简短版本。<a href=\"https://github.com/ancsemi/Haven/blob/main/GUIDE.md\">指南</a>里有全部内容。",
  "Chat": "聊天",
  "Text channels, threads and forums": "文字频道、话题和论坛",
  "Voice chat": "语音聊天",
  "Screen sharing, with more than one stream at a time": "屏幕共享，可以同时共享多路画面",
  "Watch videos and listen to music together": "一起看视频、一起听音乐",
  "Encrypted direct messages": "加密私信",
  "Reactions, stickers, polls and GIFs": "回应、贴纸、投票和 GIF",
  "Coming from Discord": "从 Discord 迁移",
  "Import your whole server, including threads, pins and attachments": "导入整个服务器，包括话题、置顶消息和附件",
  "Ferry bridges a Haven channel to a Discord channel, so friends who stay behind can still talk to you": "Ferry 把 Haven 频道和 Discord 频道连起来，留在那边的朋友也能和你聊天",
  "Roles and permissions that work the way you're used to": "身份组和权限，用起来和你习惯的一样",
  "Customization": "个性化",
