  "Freemium": "免费增值",
  "Join from a browser, nothing to install": "用浏览器就能加入，无需安装",
  "Works in a phone's browser": "在手机浏览器里可用",
  "Pushes you to the app": "会引导你去用应用",
  "Import your history from Discord": "从 Discord 导入历史记录",
  "Via a bridge": "通过桥接",
  "Free tiers and default hosted setups, as of September 2026.": "免费档和默认的托管方案，截至 2026 年 9 月。",
  "No terminal, no config files. There's a Docker image too.": "不用终端，不用配置文件。也有 Docker 镜像。",
  "<strong>Download the zip</strong> and unzip it anywhere.": "<strong>下载压缩包</strong>，解压到任意位置。",
  "<strong>Double-click <code>Start Haven.bat</code></strong> (<code>start.sh</code> on Mac and Linux). It sets everything up and prints your link. If Node.js isn't installed yet, it offers to install it for you.": "<strong>双击 <code>Start Haven.bat</code></strong>（Mac 和 Linux 上是 <code>start.sh</code>）。它会把一切设置好，并显示你的链接。如果还没装 Node.js，它会提示帮你安装。",
  "<strong>Send the link to your friends.</strong> They can use a browser, the desktop app or the Android and iOS apps.": "<strong>把链接发给朋友。</strong>他们可以用浏览器、桌面应用，或者 Android 和 iOS 应用。",
  "Security and privacy": "安全与隐私",
  "How it actually works.": "它实际上是怎么运作的。",
  "<strong>Your data lives on the computer running the server,</strong> in one folder. Back it up, move it or delete it whenever you want.": "<strong>你的数据都在运行服务器的那台电脑上，</strong>放在一个文件夹里。想备份、搬走还是删掉，随你。",
  "<strong>Direct messages are end-to-end encrypted.</strong> The server stores them but can't read them, and neither can the admin.": "<strong>私信是端到端加密的。</strong>服务器会存储它们，但读不了，管理员也读不了。",
  "<strong>Channel messages aren't end-to-end encrypted.</strong> Whoever runs the server can read them, just like a Discord admin can. Join servers run by people you trust, or run your own.": "<strong>频道消息没有端到端加密。</strong>运行服务器的人可以读到，就像 Discord 的管理员一样。请加入你信任的人运行的服务器，或者自己运行一个。",
  "<strong>Connections use HTTPS.</strong> Haven creates its own certificate the first time it starts, and you can swap in a real one.": "<strong>连接使用 HTTPS。</strong>Haven 第一次启动时会创建自己的证书，你也可以换成正式的证书。",
  "<strong>No telemetry.</strong> The server doesn't send usage data or crash reports anywhere.": "<strong>没有遥测。</strong>服务器不会把使用数据或崩溃报告发到任何地方。",
  "<strong>There's no central Haven server and no Haven account.</strong> Nothing to leak.": "<strong>没有中央 Haven 服务器，也没有 Haven 账号。</strong>没有什么可泄露的。",
  "Joining from a phone browser. No app needed.": "在手机浏览器里加入，不需要安装应用。",
  "What the server connects to": "服务器会连接哪些地方",
  "Every outside service a Haven server contacts, and when.": "Haven 服务器会联系的每一个外部服务，以及什么时候联系。",
