  "Most people only need the app. The server download is just for whoever hosts one.": "大多数人只需要应用。服务器下载只给托管服务器的人用。",
  "The app for joining a server. Adds per-app audio sharing, mid-call device switching and a system tray. It can run a server too.": "用来加入服务器的应用。增加了按应用共享音频、通话中切换设备和系统托盘。它也可以运行服务器。",
  "The installer isn't code-signed yet, so Windows may say \"Windows protected your PC\" the first time. Click <b>More info</b>, then <b>Run anyway</b>.": "安装程序还没有代码签名，所以第一次运行时 Windows 可能会提示“Windows 已保护你的电脑”。点击<b>更多信息</b>，再点击<b>仍要运行</b>。",
